==Dutch==

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|aːmən|lang=nl}}
* {{audio|Nl-ramen.ogg|audio|lang=nl}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|dum|nl}} {{term|ramen||to aim, to strive for, to guess|lang=dum}}, possibly from {{etyl|odt|nl}} {{m|odt|*rāmon}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|nl}} {{m|gem-pro|*rēmijaną}}, {{m|gem-pro|*rēmāną}}. Cognate with Old High German {{term|rāmēn|lang=goh}} (German {{term|anberaumen|lang=de}} with vowel by analogy with {{term|Raum|lang=de}}).

====Verb====
{{nl-verb|raamde|geraamd}}

# {{context|transitive|lang=nl}} To make an [[estimate]]
# {{context|transitive|lang=nl}} To fix an estimate, [[budget]]
#: ''Het project kost 6 keer meer dan geraamd''
# {{context|obsolete|transitive|lang=nl}} To [[guess]], reckon; deduce
# {{context|obsolete|transitive|lang=nl}} To [[take aim]] (at); [[watch]], [[observe]]
# {{context|obsolete|transitive|lang=nl}} To [[hit]]

=====Conjugation=====
{{nl-conj-wk|raam|rame}}

=====Synonyms=====
* (make an estimate) [[schatten]]
* (fix an estimate) [[begroten]]

