# {{context|transitive|lang=nl}} To [[arrange]] [[bushels]] of [[cereal]]s on the field in a certain way
# {{context|transitive|lang=nl}} To [[tie]] a bird's [[wing]]s together to prevent it flying away

=====Conjugation=====
{{nl-conj-wk|raam|rame}}

=====Derived terms=====
